    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are proud to present 43 Grosvenor Road, Rathgar, Dublin 6, D06 NA49 to the market.\r\n\r\nA most attractive double-fronted period house presently sub-divided into 5 units and ideally suited continued use as same or restoration to family home. \r\n\r\nExcellently maintained and recently upgraded and divided into 3x bedsitting rooms, 2x one-bedroom flats.\r\n\r\nSet in low maintenance gardens with side access.\r\n\r\nMuch sought-after location midway between the villages of Rathgar and Rathmines, beside bus routes, LUAS, sports facilities, and a wide range of schools including Rathgar Junior and National schools, St. Louis, St. Mary’s, The High School, Alexandra College, Gonzaga, etc.\r\n\r\nThe property is within easy reach of the M50 and city centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nCeiling coving and centre rose. Tiled floor.\r\nUnit 1\r\nBedsitting room\r\nKitchenette, showerroom.\r\nUnit 2\r\nBedsitting room\r\nKitchenette, showerroom.\r\nRear lobby\r\nW.C., WHB\r\n\r\n1st Floor Return\r\nUnit 3\r\nFlat\r\nLiving/kitchen\r\nFitted units, sink unit, stairs to\r\nBedroom\r\nShowerroom\r\n1st floor\r\nUnit 4\r\nFlat\r\nLiving room\r\nMarble mantlepiece, ceiling cornice, and centre rose x2.\r\nInner Hall\r\nTiled floor.\r\nBedroom\r\nKitchen\r\nFitted units, sink unit.\r\nShowerroom\r\nShower, W.C., WHB.\r\n1st Floor Return\r\nUnit 5\r\nBedsitting room\r\nKitchenette, showerroom.\r\nOutside\r\nLow maintenance front and rear gardens, side entrance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "C. 178 Sq. M / 1915 Sq. Ft.\r\nGFCH\r\nSide access\r\nD/glazed\r\nBeside bus routes, LUAS, schools, etc.\r\nBeside Rathgar and Ranelagh villages.\r\nConvenient to M50 and city centre."
      },
